  "uses": {
    "critical_tail": "Exact n=2r>=14, natural G0=Alt(B), H intransitive on its support, under full standing hypotheses and smaller-degree alternating induction.",
    "ambient_interval": "Full globally eligible interval rank <= n minus all actual orbits, including fixed vertices.",
    "endpoint_centralizer": "Entire fixed-point-free residual theorem, including actual independent pair images, retained Whiston equality and paid paired-row centralizer proof. No transitivity of H on X is assumed; the complement delta itself must be fixed-point-free.",
